{"3946230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JANKLADY", "steam_appid": 3946230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;JANKLADY&quot;</strong> is an RPG where you aim to clear stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946230/extras/24547391abed03de14dab16a628d7c49.avif?t=1768175094\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were once a noble lady of a castle, living peacefully—or so it should have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you awoke, all that remained was a desolate wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must crawl out from your underground shelter and head toward the promised place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your iron body will fall countless times for that purpose… and rise again just as many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946230/extras/7b8192fa03bca36972441a7c06be2ed5.avif?t=1768175094\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat — survive to the end and defeat the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn bonuses each time you return to base, then challenge the stage again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam 2D maps, examine objects, and improve your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with residents to advance the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources carefully as you head into battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>She</i> is destroyed. <i>She</i> is made.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated p